Package: IntegrateProtRNA
Title: RNA-Protein Multi-Omics Integration Pipeline (Case B)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: R pipeline for integrating RNA-seq and quantitative proteomics
    from an unpaired (Case B) time-course design. Not an installable R
    package -- this DESCRIPTION file exists only to drive renv's "explicit"
    dependency snapshot (renv.lock), listing exactly the packages the
    pipeline in R/ and analysis/ actually requires, rather than renv
    auto-scanning every package mentioned anywhere (including optional
    fallbacks documented in env/install_r_deps.R).
Imports:
    BiocManager,
    DESeq2,
    edgeR,
    igraph,
    impute,
    knitr,
    limma,
    matrixStats,
    yaml
Suggests:
    ComplexHeatmap,
    imputeLCMD,
    missForest,
    mixOmics,
    MOFA2,
    OmicsPLS,
    preprocessCore,
    rmarkdown,
    vsn
